{
  "$defs": {
    "CommitOutcome": {
      "description": "提交结果：新 snapshot，或同一 batch 已提交（幂等重放）。",
      "enum": [
        "committed",
        "already_committed"
      ],
      "title": "CommitOutcome",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "CommitRequest": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一次 append 提交请求。batch 数据作为 `commit_batch` 的独立参数传入，不进入 DTO。\n\n- `batch_id`：稳定的幂等身份（例如由 Raw revision 与表名形成），重试时可从 Raw / staging\n  重建同一批；\n- `batch_fingerprint`：调用方按该表的版本化指纹规则算出的 batch 内容指纹；adapter 必须从\n  实际 batch 独立重算并核对，不信任这个声明；\n- `row_count >= 1`：空 batch 不提交（避免\"reader 被消费后写入零行\"被当成成功，ADR-0023 §7）；\n- `expected_parent_snapshot_id` 必须显式给出：`null` 表示期望该表尚无 snapshot。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "batch_id": {
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:=@+-]{0,255}$",
          "title": "Batch Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "batch_fingerprint": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Batch Fingerprint",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "row_count": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Row Count",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "expected_parent_snapshot_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:=@+-]{0,255}$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Expected Parent Snapshot Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "table",
        "batch_id",
        "batch_fingerprint",
        "row_count",
        "expected_parent_snapshot_id"
      ],
      "title": "CommitRequest",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SnapshotInfo": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个表 snapshot 的中立元数据。\n\n- `parent_snapshot_id` 必须显式给出，`null` 表示该表的首个 snapshot；不得等于自身；\n- `batch_id` 与 `batch_fingerprint` 同时给出或同时为空（非 batch 产生的 snapshot，\n  例如未来的 maintenance）；\n- `added_rows <= total_rows`；\n- `committed_at` 是 catalog 记录的提交时间，只作审计。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "table": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*\\.[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Table",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:=@+-]{0,255}$",
          "title": "Snapshot Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "parent_snapshot_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:=@+-]{0,255}$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Parent Snapshot Id"
        },
        "committed_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Committed At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "batch_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:=@+-]{0,255}$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Batch Id"
        },
        "batch_fingerprint": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Batch Fingerprint"
        },
        "added_rows": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Added Rows",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "total_rows": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Total Rows",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "table",
        "snapshot_id",
        "parent_snapshot_id",
        "committed_at",
        "batch_id",
        "batch_fingerprint",
        "added_rows",
        "total_rows"
      ],
      "title": "SnapshotInfo",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`commit_batch` 的结果：请求 + 该 batch 的 snapshot + 结果类别。\n\nsnapshot 必须属于请求的表、携带请求的 `batch_id` 与指纹、`added_rows == row_count`；\n`committed` 时其父 snapshot 必须就是请求期望的父 snapshot。`already_committed` 时 snapshot\n是该 batch **首次**提交产生的那一个，其父 snapshot 可以与本次请求的期望不同。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.2.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "request": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CommitRequest"
    },
    "snapshot": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/SnapshotInfo"
    },
    "outcome": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CommitOutcome"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "request",
    "snapshot",
    "outcome"
  ],
  "title": "CommitResult",
  "type": "object"
}
